    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's just not a chapter, you know? chapters have momentum. they have meaning. this is just... it's like the well ran dry and now i'm just standing in the dust. a professional can tell me how to 'rest', but they can't give me back the part of me that's gone. if the thing that defined you is dead, what's actually left to save? it feels more like a conclusion than a setback.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
